{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_15021.jpg","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"nameNarration":"","narration":"<The next day>","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_21081.jpg","bgm":"bgm03_story06","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":300,"pos":1}],"narrationEffect":"out","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"id":305701,"pos":0}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":100,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"Akari...? Oo~ii...AA~KAA~RIII~...!"},{"chara":[{"id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"...You changed your clothes, right?@I'm going to school."},{"autoTurnLast":1.5,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":305701}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":800300,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Hotaru's Middle Sister","textLeft":"...Hey, what happened to Akari?"},{"chara":[{"id":800300}],"nameLeft":"Hotaru's Middle Sister","textLeft":"It's weird she's being absent-minded."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":800100,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Hotaru's Oldest Sister","textLeft":"Hotaru... Did you do something again?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":300,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"It wasn't meee~... Buuut...mm~...@I'll have to wait and seee~..."},{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":1,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bg":"bg_adv_15041.jpg","chara":[{"id":304801,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"Akarii... You okaaay~...?","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Same as always."},{"chara":[{"id":304801,"motion":400}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"Mm~...what should I dooo~...@You look seriously ill~..."},{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_15091.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":1,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Good morning.","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":800201,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"","textRight":"[chara:800201:effect_emotion_surprise_0][se:7226_shock]Mor...ning...?!"},{"chara":[{"id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Hotaru, be sure to study."},{"autoTurnLast":1.3,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":305701}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":800301,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"","textLeft":"W-wait, what happened?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":800201,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"","textRight":"Hotaru, you didn't do something serious@to Akari again, did you?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":800301,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"","textLeft":"You do have a record for making her cry."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":400,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"I'm tellin' yaa~... It wasn't meee~...@[chara:304801:lipSynch_0][wait:1.2][chara:304801:lipSynch_1][chara:304801:motion_300][chara:304801:eyeClose_1]Ee~nn...you guuuys...are meaaan..."},{"chara":[{"id":800301}],"nameLeft":"","textLeft":"Then what's going on?"},{"chara":[{"id":800301}],"nameLeft":"","textLeft":"I don't remember my Akari being that sketchy..."},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":304801,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"Mm~..."},{"chara":[{"id":304801,"lipSynch":0}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"(Was it that dinner party both their families@are doing to deepen their relations...?)"},{"chara":[{"id":304801,"lipSynch":0}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"(She's worried over that...?)"},{"chara":[{"id":304801,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"(But Yuuna and herself and her buddies weren't@interested...)"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":304801,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"I have an idea, but I might need to wait a little@and make sure..."},{"chara":[{"id":304801}],"nameRight":"Hotaru","textRight":"I don't think Akari's sorted out her own feelings yet."},{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_21171.jpg","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_21025.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":801202,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"id":800102}],"nameCenter":"","textCenter":"Goodbye, Teacher.@Goodbye, everyone!","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":801202}],"textClear":1},{"nameNarration":"Everyone","narration":"\"Goodbye!\"","narrationEffect":"in"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"Akari","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"…………"},{"autoTurnLast":1.5,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":305701}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":801300,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":801201,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"","textLeft":"...Akari, are you okay?"},{"chara":[{"id":801201}],"nameRight":"","textRight":"You don't look well..."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21021.jpg","bgm":"stop","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_15091.jpg","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_15041.jpg","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21141.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story12","chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"…………","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(I can't get what Big Bro Haruto said yesterday)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(out of my head...)"},{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_15022.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":800400,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"blackFrame"},{"chara":[{"id":800400}],"nameCenter":"Haruto Nikaido","textCenter":"I'm thinking... Of giving up on love.","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.8,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":800400,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"chara":[{"id":800400}],"nameCenter":"Haruto Nikaido","textCenter":"If I'm going to inherit the company,@then it can't be for myself alone.","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_21141.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":1,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"stop"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(Big bro was thinking about his family@and the company,)","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(and I had no idea...)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":200}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(By trying so hard to make myself look equal@to big bro,)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(I thought I was getting closer to him,@little by little.)"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(It wasn't my efforts paying off,)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(it's because big bro was adjusting to me...)"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(Because big bro...)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(sincerely thinks about everyone around him)"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(while I've only been thinking of myself...)"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"…………"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":100}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(I don't want to act like he isn't getting married,)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(not because of Big Bro Haruto or Yuuna,)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(or because I like big bro...)"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(I just don't want him taken away from me.)"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(I haven't even thought of what would happen@after that...)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"motion":300,"tear":1}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"I really am such a child...@I haven't grown up at all..."},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(What big bro said yesterday is right.)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(If I want to grow up, I have to support him.)"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"(I have to give up my feelings too.)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"……………"},{"chara":[{"cheek":1,"id":305701,"motion":100}],"nameCenter":"Akari","textCenter":"...But I still hate it."},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"}]},"version":3}
